1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,354
Exam tip.

2
00:00:01,354 --> 00:00:04,466
Whole-number means: use deviations.

3
00:00:04,466 --> 00:00:07,513
Small raw numbers: use the raw-score form.

4
00:00:07,513 --> 00:00:10,937
Awkward means: deviations from an assumed mean.

5
00:00:10,937 --> 00:00:14,947
And set out the table neatly, because the marks are in the columns.

